+b.place(7, 3, 'B'); b.place(7, 4, 'B'); b.place(7, 5, 'B'); b.place(7, 6, 'B')
+# Target (7,7): row 7 = X X X X . . . . . . . . X . . . (with (7,7) makes 5 in col)
+# After placement: row 7 stones at 0,1,2,3,7 → row has XXXX__X pattern at (0-3) and (7) alone.
+# In col 7: stones at 3,4,5,6,7 → 5-in-a-row vertical! → cnt=5 → five wins.
